<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The agriculture ministry says Mozambican farmers sold nearly 211,000 tonnes of maize last year, 49 percent more than in 1995.</p>
<p>- Flood waters are still rising on the Pungue and Buzi rivers in central Mozambique and a new danger has appeared -- crocodiles on the flooded roads. Four people have been treated for bite wounds.</p>
</text>
